        <li>Implemented VLAN segmentation, 802.1Q trunking, inter-VLAN routing, SVIs, OSPF, eBGP, for branch connectivity</li>
        <li>Implemented LACP/PAgP EtherChannel, VTP, SSH, and VPN-based remote access, then tested and troubleshot end-to-end network connectivity</li>
